{"id":30939749160,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHNCcbKA","head_branch":"claude/uganda-17-rowcontext-lateral","head_sha":"a6caaa6bb2648335dc94ae5fa8843985e783d340","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":55371,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"perf: evaluate the rowContext subquery once, in a lateral join","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":83906924980,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAATiT4RtA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30939749160","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30939749160","created_at":"2026-08-04T18:40:48Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T18:56:31Z","run_started_at":"2026-08-04T18:40:48Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30939749160/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30939749160/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/83906924980","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30939749160/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30939749160/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30939749160/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: emit the row-context lateral on the aggregated-enrollments path too\n\nFound reviewing the previous commit rather than by a failing build, which is the\nworrying part: getAggregatedEnrollmentsSql(headers, params) builds its select\nclause through the same getSelectClause, so it emitted the columns that read from\n\"rowcontext_0\" and then wrapped them in an outer count without ever joining the\nlateral in. Any aggregate enrollment request with rowContext=true and a repeatable\nstage would have produced SQL referencing a table that is not in the query.\n\nNot reachable from the traced request, and no existing test covered the\ncombination, so nothing went red. The new test asserts both halves - three columns\nreading off the lateral, and exactly one lateral declared - and fails with\n\"expected: \u003c1\u003e but was: \u003c0\u003e\" when the join is removed again.\n\nThe general rule, now written at the call site: every assembly that calls\ngetSelectClause has to append getRowContextJoinClause. There are exactly two.\n\nRefs UGANDA-17.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"stian-sandvold","email":"stian@dhis2.org"},"id":"a6caaa6bb2648335dc94ae5fa8843985e783d340","tree_id":"7bc3a6b64bf925357acd19d41346ff66ff0999f6","timestamp":"2026-08-04T15:42:34Z","committer":{"name":"stian-sandvold","email":"stian@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fork":false,"private":fal